# **CADEM – Computer Aided Engineering Drawing & Modelling**

## 📚 TE Electrical Engineering – SPPU 2024 Pattern

Welcome to the **CADEM** resources folder for **Third Year Electrical Engineering (TE Electrical)** students under the **SPPU 2024 Pattern**.

This folder is created to provide all important **CADEM study and practical resources** in one place. Students can easily access and download the required files directly without any ZIP file.

### 📂 Contents

- 📄 **PDF Drawings & Notes**
- 📐 **Engineering Drawings**
- 💻 **CAD Drawing Files**
- 📝 **Practical / Assignment Files**
- 📚 **Study Material**
- 📑 **Other useful CADEM resources**

### 🎯 Purpose

The main purpose of this folder is to make **CADEM resources easily accessible** to TE Electrical students. Files are organized topic-wise so that students can quickly find, view, and download the required **PDF or CAD drawing file**.

